The order-client call order-service thought the service-registry
1. Create rest-client-with-service-registry project
2. Create 3 module order-client, order-service, service-discovery
3. Create order client
    dependencies: rest-client, http-client, eureka-client, loadbalancer, web
    Config 2 restclient bean: 1 for Loadbalance, 1 is Primary restclient
    create order client forward request to order-service
4. Create order-service
    create controller
5. Create service-discovery
   dependencies netflix-eureka-server
   application config
            register-with-eureka: false // no need register server with eureka
            fetch-registry: false    // no fetch from other registry
6. Add spring security/ oauthorization-server into order-client

7. order-service -> to resource server
   order-authorization-server -> add security
   order client -> service-registry -> oauthorization-server

